          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li
              Landon D. C. Elkind, Richard Zach,
              %em
                The Genealogy of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo ∨
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \vee
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.06072"}> arXiv:2012.06072
              )
          %p The definition of the disjunction of two types in dependent type theory as the propositional truncation of the sum type is found in:
          %ul
            %li#UFP13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Univalent+Foundations+Project"}> Univalent Foundations Project
              , §3.7 in:
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Homotopy+Type+Theory+--+Univalent+Foundations+of+Mathematics"} Homotopy Type Theory – Univalent Foundations of Mathematics
              (2013) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://homotopytypetheory.org/book/"}> web
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://hottheory.files.wordpress.com/2013/03/hott-online-323-g28e4374.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The definition of the disjunction of two mere propositions in dependent type theory as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/join+type"} join type
            of propositions is found in:
          %ul
            %li#Shulman13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Shulman"}> Mike Shulman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Cohomology
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://homotopytypetheory.org/2013/07/24/cohomology/"} web
          %p And the disjunction of two types defined from the type of propositions and dependent product types can be found in:
          %ul
            %li
              Madeleine Birchfield,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructing coproduct types and boolean types from universes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/questions/457904/constructing-coproduct-types-and-boolean-types-from-universes"} web
